\[ \vec{a} \times \vec{b} = \begin{vmatrix} 3 & 4 \\ 2 & 1 \end{vmatrix} = (3 \cdot 1) - (4 \cdot 2) = 3 - 8 = -5 \]
   Note: This result represents the signed area (positive or negative depending on the orientation) and the actual magnitude is \(| -5 | = 5\).

